00:15:02,962 --> 00:15:05,512
今日の どこかにあるよ
Today's somewhere out there...

155
00:15:07,702 --> 00:15:09,652
1・2・3で飛び出せ
Jump out with 1, 2, 3!

156
00:15:10,502 --> 00:15:11,952
散々だって泣いていた
Crying that it was a mess,

157
00:15:12,562 --> 00:15:16,562
日々 と ボール の 外 まで
days and beyond the ball's reach,

158
00:15:18,412 --> 00:15:19,972
「どこへ行こうか」は
"Where shall we go?"

159
00:15:20,502 --> 00:15:22,842
「どこへだって行けるでしょ?」
"We can go anywhere, right?"

160
00:15:22,982 --> 00:15:26,642
息つく 暇など ない トライ! トライ!
There's no time to even breathe! Try, try!

161
00:15:27,332 --> 00:15:28,432
Why don't we go?

162
00:15:29,112 --> 00:15:30,842
1 言葉を超えて 2
Transcending words, 1,

163
00:15:31,282 --> 00:15:34,342
境界線の先の まだ見ぬ君まで
to still-unseen you beyond the boundary line, 2,

164
00:15:37,812 --> 00:15:38,492
3

165
00:15:38,962 --> 00:15:43,902
倒れるなら 手をつくなら 前だって決めたんだ
If I fall, if I reach out, I decided to go forward!

166
00:15:44,472 --> 00:15:48,362
日が沈むように影伸びて 背丈も変わっているけど
Shadows lengthen like the setting sun, our heights have changed too, but

167
00:15:49,382 --> 00:15:50,752
レッツゴー!
Let's go!

168
00:15:50,722 --> 00:15:51,972
雨上がりでなくちゃ
It has to be after the rain,

169
00:15:52,082 --> 00:15:53,282
レッツゴー!
Let's go!

170
00:15:53,202 --> 00:15:55,232
晴れ間に虹はない
without clearing, there is no rainbow.

171
00:15:55,182 --> 00:15:58,172
あの日から気づいている
I've noticed since that day.

172
00:16:08,512 --> 00:16:09,342
君は 君は
You, you,

173
00:16:11,042 --> 00:16:16,232
いつの間にかやらか大人になっちゃいないかい?
have you somehow grown up before we knew it?

174
00:16:18,072 --> 00:16:20,592
ほこりを被った ボロ着の 右ポケットに置いてきた
Left behind in the right pocket of dusty, tattered clothes,

175
00:16:23,772 --> 00:16:27,732
片手に収まる冒険 ボクらの全てだった
adventure fitting in one hand was everything to us.

176
00:16:29,212 --> 00:16:34,332
あの頃の思い出が 君を探しているよ
Memories of those days are searching for you!

177
00:16:37,312 --> 00:16:39,332
1・2・3で飛び込め
Dive in with 1, 2, 3!

178
00:16:40,002 --> 00:16:45,652
いつか描いた未来がボクの ポケットにあるから
The future we once envisioned is in my pocket, so

179
00:16:47,852 --> 00:16:49,312
どこへ行こうよ
let's go somewhere!

180
00:16:49,782 --> 00:16:51,972
どこへだって連れてってよ
Take me anywhere!

181
00:16:52,942 --> 00:16:55,932
ためらうことなど ない トライ! トライ!
There's no hesitation, try, try!

182
00:16:56,842 --> 00:16:58,022
Let's have a fight!

183
00:16:58,252 --> 00:17:00,672
1 バトルをしたら 2
If we battle, 1, 2,

184
00:17:01,812 --> 00:17:06,212
笑うか泣いたって3で 仲間になろうよ
whether we laugh or cry, let's become friends at 3!

185
00:17:08,242 --> 00:17:12,982
あの日だって この日だって いつだってそうしていた
That day, this day, it was always like that.

186
00:17:13,682 --> 00:17:18,732
先も見えない 果ても知らない 世界がそこにあるけど
A world where we don't know the end or beyond is right there, but

187
00:17:19,072 --> 00:17:19,772
レッツゴー!
Let's go!

188
00:17:19,972 --> 00:17:21,392
転んですりむいて
Stumbling and scraping our knees,

189
00:17:21,392 --> 00:17:22,052
レッツゴー!
Let's go!

190
00:17:22,602 --> 00:17:27,032
何度も歩き出す隣 キミにきめた!
I chose you by my side as I walk again and again!

191
00:18:50,267 --> 00:18:50,817
Oh… しんでしまうとは 情けない
Oh... To die like this...

192
00:18:52,997 --> 00:18:53,717
情けない!
is pathetic!

193
00:18:54,307 --> 00:18:55,237
3.2.1… 王!
3, 2, 1... King!

194
00:19:06,027 --> 00:19:06,147
王!
King!

195
00:19:06,847 --> 00:19:07,087
なに? HELP!
What? HELP!

196
00:19:08,117 --> 00:19:08,627
何事じゃ ひい
What's wrong? Eek!

197
00:19:10,067 --> 00:19:11,047
姫がさらわれましたぁ
The princess has been kidnapped!

198
00:19:11,367 --> 00:19:11,767
勇者は?
The hero?

199
00:19:12,387 --> 00:19:12,917
いません
Isn't here.

200
00:19:13,167 --> 00:19:13,597
うーん、そうだ!
Hmm, I know!

201
00:19:14,327 --> 00:19:15,367
かくなる上はお前が勇者だ
In that case, you are the hero!

202
00:19:15,847 --> 00:19:16,327
設定崩壊••!!
Setting broken!!

203
00:19:17,797 --> 00:19:21,397
さぁ、その宝箱の中身とこのなけなしの金で旅立って仲間を探して化けもん倒して••
Now go set off with that treasure chest's contents and meager gold, find companions, and defeat the monsters...

204
00:19:21,397 --> 00:19:22,147
••適当だねぇか
Well, that's pretty casual!

205
00:19:22,987 --> 00:19:25,707
とにかく困ったら町のの人々に話しかけようぜ ボスとか全然倒せる!倒せる! マ・ジ・デ!
Anyway, if you're in trouble, talk to the townspeople! You can totally beat the bosses! Beat them! Seriously!

206
00:19:28,247 --> 00:19:28,477
ばって ばって ばって 当然
Brag, brag, brag, naturally,

207
00:19:30,397 --> 00:19:31,737
だって実際に一番偉いから!
because actually, I'm the greatest!

208
00:19:33,907 --> 00:19:34,417
人ごみたくいってくれるぜ
You speak to us like we're lesser beings,

209
00:19:35,957 --> 00:19:37,247
まったくもって上から目線すぎるぜ..
totally looking down on us from above!

210
00:19:39,317 --> 00:19:41,397
経験値 経験値 経験値 積んで
Gain experience, gain experience, gain experience, pile it up,

211
00:19:42,387 --> 00:19:44,437
もっと屈強な仲間探したまえ!
and find even tougher companions!

212
00:19:45,277 --> 00:19:45,677
ていうか私は一兵卒です
I mean, I'm just a foot soldier!

213
00:19:47,587 --> 00:19:47,947
有給休暇がデリート!デリート!
Paid leave is a date! A date!

214
00:19:50,817 --> 00:19:55,237
「そなたがラスボスを倒してくる日を楽しみに待っておるぞい!」
"I'm looking forward to the day you defeat the final boss!"

215
00:19:56,057 --> 00:19:58,177
世界平和を取り戻すため お国の平和を守るため
To reclaim world peace, to protect our country's peace,

216
00:20:00,047 --> 00:20:01,017
一番
first...

217
00:20:02,074 --> 00:20:04,084
Oh…しんでしまうとはなさけない！
Oh... If you die, that won't do!

218
00:20:04,274 --> 00:20:04,964
3.2.1…×××!!
3, 2, 1... ×××!!

219
00:20:05,154 --> 00:20:05,534
「王!」
"King!"

220
00:20:05,574 --> 00:20:05,914
「なに?」
"What?"

221
00:20:05,934 --> 00:20:06,234
「HELP!」
"HELP!"

222
00:20:06,254 --> 00:20:06,614
「何事じゃ」
"What's wrong?"

223
00:20:06,634 --> 00:20:07,364
「ひっ、姫がさらわれましたぁ!」
"H-The princess has been kidnapped!"

224
00:20:07,464 --> 00:20:07,764
「勇者は?」
"The hero?"

225
00:20:07,784 --> 00:20:08,134
「いません」
"Absent."

226
00:20:08,154 --> 00:20:09,364
「うーん、そうだ!かくなる上はお前が勇者だ」
"Well, that settles it! You are the hero now!"

227
00:20:09,424 --> 00:20:10,104
設定崩壊••!!
Setting broken...!!

228
00:20:10,124 --> 00:20:12,464
「さあ、その宝箱の中身とこのなかなしの金で旅立って仲間を探して化け物倒して••」
"Now go, use the contents of that treasure chest and that meager gold to set off, find companions, and defeat the monsters..."

229
00:20:12,484 --> 00:20:13,034
(••適当じゃねえか)
(That's pretty random!)

230
00:20:13,054 --> 00:20:15,634
「とにかく困ったら町のひとたちに話しかけようぜ?ボスとか全然倒せる!倒せる!マ・ジ・デ!」
"Anyway, if you're in trouble, talk to the townspeople! You can totally beat the boss! Beat him! MA-JI-DE!"

231
00:20:15,674 --> 00:20:17,484
いばって いばって いばって 当然
Right, right, right, obviously!

232
00:20:17,504 --> 00:20:18,424
だって実際に一番偉いからでからです
Because we're actually the most important ones, after all!

233
00:20:18,684 --> 00:20:19,604
人ごとみたいに扱ってくれるぜ
Treating people like subordinates,

234
00:20:19,764 --> 00:20:20,724
まったくもって上から目線すぎぜ..
you're way too condescending...

235
00:20:20,864 --> 00:20:21,814
経験値 経験値 経験値 積んで
Accumulating EXP, EXP, EXP,

236
00:20:21,664 --> 00:20:22,644
もっと屈強な仲間探したまえ!
we gotta find stronger companions!

237
00:20:22,844 --> 00:20:23,794
てゆおか私は一兵卒です
Teyuhika, I'm just a foot soldier.

238
00:20:23,524 --> 00:20:24,464
有給休暇がデリート!デリート!
Paid leave is a date! A date!

239
00:20:24,704 --> 00:20:30,894
「あなたがラスボスを倒してくる日を楽しみにしておるぞい!」
"Looking forward to the day you defeat the final boss!"

240
00:20:31,194 --> 00:20:32,174
世界平和を取り戻す為、
To restore world peace,

241
00:20:32,224 --> 00:20:33,204
お国の平和を守る為、
to protect our country's peace,

242
00:20:33,474 --> 00:20:34,434
一番後ろでシキを取ります
we'll take the rear and take notes.

243
00:20:34,424 --> 00:20:35,384
あなたの経験値を伝えましょう
Let's pass on your experience points!

244
00:20:35,404 --> 00:20:36,354
あなたの為に 世界の為に
For you, for the world,

245
00:20:37,254 --> 00:20:38,384
戦う僕らの愛国心
our patriotic hearts are fighting!

246
00:20:38,314 --> 00:20:39,284
仲間も死んで絶滅寸前
Even our comrades died and we're on the verge of extinction—

247
00:20:39,714 --> 00:20:41,064
やっぱりレベルが足りねえ..orz
guess our level wasn't high enough... orz

248
00:20:42,844 --> 00:20:45,714
「あなたのパーティーは全滅しました。おお、神様よ! アーメン」
"Your party has been completely wiped out. Oh, Lord! Amen."

249
00:20:55,322 --> 00:20:57,652
おお!しんでしまうとはなさけない!
Oh! If you die, that's pathetic!

250
00:20:57,692 --> 00:20:58,352
させればそなたにもういちど、きかいをあたえよう
If you do, I'll give you another chance!

251
00:20:58,962 --> 00:20:59,142
「王様っ」
"King?"

252
00:20:59,442 --> 00:20:59,602
「なんですか」
"What is it?"

253
00:21:00,062 --> 00:21:00,242
「もう…!」
"HELP!"

254
00:21:00,412 --> 00:21:00,772
もう無理です
"It's impossible."

255
00:21:00,992 --> 00:21:01,572
「えぇーっ!弱音を吐くとはもっと情けなぁぁぁい!」
"What?! Expressing weakness is even more pathetic!"

256
00:21:04,974 --> 00:21:05,154
経済力、軍事力ともに申し分ない我が国は当然、
Our country is naturally top-tier in both economic and military power,

257
00:21:06,234 --> 00:21:07,054
優秀な人材も潤沢、人望暑いね
and we're overflowing with brilliant talent!

258
00:21:08,614 --> 00:21:09,364
ただ、ひとつ万国的な問題点は国家元首の本音さ
Only one universal problem: the head of state's true nature.

259
00:21:11,084 --> 00:21:12,104
よく言えば無垢、悪く言えば.. O・BA・KA
Put nicely, it's flawless; put bluntly... O・BA・KA!

260
00:21:15,574 --> 00:21:15,864
正真正銘 全人類は戦闘民族 言うまでもない (OK?)
To state the obvious, all humans are a warrior race, needless to say (OK?).

261
00:21:19,014 --> 00:21:19,324
協調性や、順応性が重要なんて
Saying cooperation and adaptability are important?

262
00:21:20,374 --> 00:21:20,864
ウキヨはクソゲーか?!
What is this, a crappy game?!

263
00:21:22,124 --> 00:21:23,034
次のレベルになるには あと1000ポイントの経験が
To reach the next level, you need 1,000 more EXP.

264
00:21:26,424 --> 00:21:27,544
さらにはもっと自己主張が必要じゃ くじけるな OK?
What's more, you need more self-assertion, so don't get discouraged, OK?

265
00:21:38,372 --> 00:21:38,512
テリッサ ボロソン ザンシ パロントわ
Terissa, doroson, zanshi, paronto—

266
00:21:40,202 --> 00:21:40,842
魔法使いも使いもんになってきたが
even the mages are becoming useless.

267
00:21:42,352 --> 00:21:43,222
余裕しゃくしゃくうさら笑いで ごたくばっかり並べてしゃくにさわるぜ..
Grinning with a smug face, stacking up excuses, rubbing it in our faces!

268
00:21:49,182 --> 00:21:49,332
ホリット ホリット ホリット ばっか
Holitt, holitt, holitt, bakka—

269
00:21:51,142 --> 00:21:51,832
僧侶はホリットばっかでバカなの?
are the clerics just full of holitts and idiots?

270
00:21:53,972 --> 00:21:54,512
王のアタシを眠らすなんてあんたいったい何様?さては謀反か?
Interrupting the king's nap, just who do you think you are? Is this treason?

271
00:21:59,892 --> 00:22:00,152
「僕は勇者ではありません。むしろ王が勇者だと思いまーす!」
"I am not the hero! I think the king is the hero instead!"

272
00:22:05,802 --> 00:22:06,042
世界平和を取り戻す為、
To restore world peace,

273
00:22:06,972 --> 00:22:07,132
お国の平和を守る為、
to protect our country's peace,

274
00:22:10,742 --> 00:22:11,122
最前線に身を投じませ
we throw ourselves onto the front lines,

275
00:22:13,782 --> 00:22:14,342
支持率アップは目に見えた! (おいこら)
and our approval rating surge is plain to see! (Hey, come on!)

276
00:22:16,942 --> 00:22:17,302
権益のため お金ののため
Fighting for authority, fighting for money—

277
00:22:19,602 --> 00:22:20,012
戦う王様 何を見る
what is the fighting king even looking at?

278
00:22:22,102 --> 00:22:22,422
近衛も瀕死絶滅寸前
Even the royal guard is on the verge of starvation and extinction—

279
00:22:24,512 --> 00:22:25,182
しんでしまうとはなさけなぁぁぁい!
if you die, how pathetic!

280
00:22:27,982 --> 00:22:28,122
世界平和を取り戻す為、
To restore world peace,

281
00:22:29,742 --> 00:22:29,972
あなたの笑顔を守る為、
to protect your smile,

282
00:22:33,202 --> 00:22:33,912
魔王軍関連情報を 命からがらにかき集め
we desperately scrape together intel on the Demon King's army,

283
00:22:38,412 --> 00:22:39,002
今日も今日とて鎮座している まことの勇者を待っている
and today too, we sit on our thrones, waiting for a true hero!

284
00:22:44,092 --> 00:22:44,452
他力本願ではありません
It's not about leaving things to others,

285
00:22:46,422 --> 00:22:46,972
お城じゃ奴らにかなわねぇ::
we just can't beat the castle guards::

286
00:23:46,701 --> 00:23:47,341
my little sister, i love you

287
00:23:48,701 --> 00:23:49,331
my little angel, very very cute

288
00:23:50,501 --> 00:23:51,201
my little sister, i love you

289
00:23:54,221 --> 00:23:55,021
do you know what i mean?

290
00:23:59,166 --> 00:23:59,436
聞いて 聞いて 私 お姉ちゃんなだよ
Listen, listen, I'm the big sister!

291
00:24:04,776 --> 00:24:05,156
遊ぼ 遊ぼ あなた まだ 喋れないよね?
Play with me, play with me! You still can't talk yet, right?

292
00:24:10,186 --> 00:24:10,526
お下がり普通は嫌でしょ?
Acting all high and mighty usually sucks, right?

293
00:24:12,106 --> 00:24:12,546
むしろ柔らかんできてっる
Rather, I've been coming prepared.

294
00:24:16,026 --> 00:24:16,286
完璧を演じなくっちゃ
I've gotta act all perfect,

295
00:24:17,986 --> 00:24:18,436
理想のお姉ちゃんなもん
'cause I'm the ideal big sister!

296
00:24:20,996 --> 00:24:21,416
弱さを見せないことが逆に弱点なんです
Not showing any weakness—that's actually a weak point in itself.

297
00:24:27,216 --> 00:24:27,546
平等にチャンスはあるから負けない私!
Everyone gets an equal chance, so I won't lose!

298
00:24:32,596 --> 00:24:32,936
あなたの夢は右で
Your dream is on the right,

299
00:24:34,966 --> 00:24:35,346
私の夢は左
and my dream is on the left.

300
00:24:38,146 --> 00:24:38,516
ゆらゆらと迷っても
Even if we wander around swaying,

301
00:24:40,696 --> 00:24:41,066
諦めない性格よ
we have a stubborn personality!

302
00:24:43,786 --> 00:24:44,086
泣きたい時は泣いて
When you want to cry, cry it out;

303
00:24:46,706 --> 00:24:47,006
笑いたい時は笑って
when you want to laugh, laugh it out!

304
00:24:49,836 --> 00:24:50,226
疲れたら休みましょう
When you're tired, let's take a rest;

305
00:24:52,796 --> 00:24:53,226
困ったら相談乗るから
when you're troubled, I'll hear you out.

306
00:24:55,896 --> 00:24:56,296
理由があるとするれば
If there's a reason for it all,

307
00:24:58,546 --> 00:24:58,916
あなたは私の天使
you are my angel.

308
00:25:01,972 --> 00:25:04,105
my little sister, I love you

309
00:25:04,105 --> 00:25:05,925
my little angel, very very cute

310
00:25:05,925 --> 00:25:07,145
my little sister, I love you

311
00:25:07,145 --> 00:25:09,385
Do you know what I mean?

312
00:25:09,795 --> 00:25:12,565
聞いて聞いて 私お姉ちゃんなんだよ
Listen, listen, I'm your older sister, you know?

313
00:25:13,725 --> 00:25:15,595
遊ぼ遊ぼ あなたまだ喋れないのね?
Let's play, let's play, you still can't talk yet, can you?

314
00:25:16,365 --> 00:25:18,455
お下がり 普通は嫌でしょ?
Hand-me-downs are usually unappealing, right?

315
00:25:19,035 --> 00:25:21,425
むしろ喜んで着てる
Rather, I'm happily wearing them

316
00:25:21,425 --> 00:25:24,035
完璧を演じなくちゃ
I've got to act like a perfectionist

317
00:25:24,035 --> 00:25:26,745
理想のお姉ちゃんだもん
Since I'm the ideal older sister, you see

318
00:25:26,745 --> 00:25:29,735
弱さを見せないこと逆が弱点なんです
Not showing weakness is actually a weakness itself

319
00:25:29,735 --> 00:25:32,905
平等にチャンスはあるから… 負けるな私!
Since there's a fair chance available... don't lose, me!

320
00:25:32,905 --> 00:25:35,375
あなたの夢は右で 私の夢は左
Your dream is on the right, and my dream is on the left

321
00:25:35,375 --> 00:25:38,605
ゆらゆらと迷っても 諦めない性格よ
Even if I waver unsteadily, I have a personality that never gives up

322
